    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "&quot;Pirarucu's Money Rush&quot; is a running game featuring Pirarucu, a shopping-loving lady from &quot;Goonya Monster.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPirarucu runs, leaps over cliffs, stomps on enemies, all amidst a rain of fireballs, just for the sake of shopping!<br />\r\nCollect the coins scattered along the way and enjoy shopping at the checkpoints!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBig Coins, Small Coins<br />\r\nThere are both big and small coins scattered throughout the stages. Aim to grab the big coins as they offer bonus points!<br />\r\nPlan Your Shopping!<br />\r\nBold shopping sprees might lead to running out of funds quickly. Plan your shopping strategically to ensure you can buy the necessary items!<br />\r\nBeware of Dangers Along the Way...<br />\r\nSmall undead creatures and fireballs flow through the stages. Colliding with them will cause damage. Defeat the undead by stomping on them and gracefully dodge the fireballs by jumping!<br />\r\nKeep Running Towards the Next Shopping Trip<br />\r\nShopping is a race against time. Pirarucu's running speed increases steadily, so aim for the checkpoints while battling the thrill of the chase!",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Pirarucu's Money Rush&quot; is a running game featuring Pirarucu, a shopping-loving lady from &quot;Goonya Monster.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPirarucu runs, leaps over cliffs, stomps on enemies, all amidst a rain of fireballs, just for the sake of shopping!<br />\r\nCollect the coins scattered along the way and enjoy shopping at the checkpoints!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBig Coins, Small Coins<br />\r\nThere are both big and small coins scattered throughout the stages. Aim to grab the big coins as they offer bonus points!<br />\r\nPlan Your Shopping!<br />\r\nBold shopping sprees might lead to running out of funds quickly. Plan your shopping strategically to ensure you can buy the necessary items!<br />\r\nBeware of Dangers Along the Way...<br />\r\nSmall undead creatures and fireballs flow through the stages. Colliding with them will cause damage. Defeat the undead by stomping on them and gracefully dodge the fireballs by jumping!<br />\r\nKeep Running Towards the Next Shopping Trip<br />\r\nShopping is a race against time. Pirarucu's running speed increases steadily, so aim for the checkpoints while battling the thrill of the chase!",
    "short_description": "From the asymmetrical party action game 'Goonya Monster' designed by Terada Tera , a spin-off work has emerged! &quot;Pirarucu's Money Rush&quot; is a side-scrolling shopping rampage game! At each stage checkpoint, which changes with every play, you can purchase items to gain an advantage in the game.",
